| Shape | Pill: nav, buttons, inputs, chips (`rounded-full`). Panels/tables: `rounded-2xl` |
| Motion | `transition-colors` on hover; Radix overlay animations; respect `prefers-reduced-motion` |
| Typography | Geist; `tabular-nums` on metrics; headings `tracking-tight` |

