## Fixture and seed data (user-visible)

**Scope:** any value an operator sees in admin — `web/src/**` fallbacks, handler dev stubs, `cmd/admin db seed`, SQL/CH fixtures, e2e payloads that mirror grid cells. Production pages are API-only (`Cold path first`); this section applies when seed, stub, or fallback data is shown.

Canonical catalog: `cmd/admin/seed_catalog.go` (`seedCustomerNames`, `seedCampaignNames`, `seedCustomerBalanceMicro`, …). Extend those arrays; do not invent parallel trash catalogs in `web/`.

### Trash naming (forbidden)

| Pattern | Examples (banned) | Required |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Tutorial tokens | `Foo`, `Bar`, `Baz`, `Qux`, `Lorem ipsum` | Industry-realistic names |
| Acme / widget | `Acme Corp`, `Widget Inc`, `Test Company`, `Demo LLC` | Distinct company-like names from seed catalog |
| Ordinal labels | `Customer 1`, `Campaign #42`, `Brand A`, `User 007` | Semantic geo/product/campaign names |
| Generic personas | `John Doe`, `Jane Doe`, `Test User`, `Admin User` | Role + domain email (`ops+104@horizon-media.io`) |
| Sequential display ids | `user-001`, `camp-0001`, `CTR_TIER_1` in name columns | UUID or opaque id; human label from catalog |
| Placeholder leaks | `TBD`, `N/A`, `xxx`, `CHANGE ME`, `your-domain.com` in grid cells | `EmptyState`, `StubBanner`, or omit column |
| Cryptic suffixes | `m1`, `n1`, `f1`, `v2_old` in visible strings | `naming.mdc` forbidden tokens |
| Copy-paste chains | `Copy of X`, `X (2)`, `X - test` on seed rows | Unique base name per seeded entity |

Input `placeholder` on empty form fields is allowed; it must not appear as row/cell/KPI data.

### Round numbers (forbidden in metrics and money)

Operators spot fake dashboards instantly. **Banned** in user-visible counts, money, rates, and deltas unless the live API returned that exact production value.

| Surface | Banned examples | Required shape |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Impressions / clicks / events | `1000`, `10000`, `50000`, `100000`, `1_000_000` | Irregular last 2–3 digits: `18473`, `902841` |
| Money (micros or display) | `$100.00`, `$50.00`, `$1,000.00`; every row ends `.00` | Non-zero cent tails; vary per row (`$4,217.38`) |
| Percentages / rates | `10.00%`, `25%`, `50%`, `100%` on every KPI row | Jagged decimals: `3.17%`, `11.84%` |
| Budget / spend | `budget == spend`, `spend = 0` on all active rows | `spend < budget`; scattered utilization |
| Time deltas | `lag: 60s`, `lag: 300s` on every freshness chip | Mixed seconds (`47`, `183`, `912`) from handler |
| Round multiples only | All values divisible by 100, 1000, or 5000 | Prime-ish offsets (`seedCustomerBalanceMicro` pattern) |

**Exception:** pagination `limit` (`25`, `50`, `100`) and UI control enums are not KPIs.

Hardcoded KPI literals in `web/src/ui/**` are banned — same class as demo KPIs (`anti-slop.mdc`).

### Duplicates (forbidden within one view)

| Rule | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| Display names | No two visible rows share the same `name` / `title` / `email` in one grid |
| Composite identity | `(customer_name, campaign_name)` pairs unique in directory views |
| Metric clones | No column where every row shows the identical number |
| Catalog modulo | `names[i%len]` only when `total > len(catalog)` **and** row `id` differs — never same name **and** same id twice on one page |
| Cross-column echo | `spend_display` must not equal `budget_display` on every row |

When seeding `N > len(catalog)`: extend arrays in `seed_catalog.go`; do not modulo-repeat visible labels on one admin page without distinct ids.

### Allowed

| Pattern | When |
| :--- | :--- |
| `EmptyState`, `ErrorBlock`, `StubBanner` | No backend / 501 |
| API-driven values | Production path |
| Deterministic dev UUIDs | `seedEntityUUID` for stable local dev |
| Form `placeholder` | Empty input hint only — not grid/KPI data |

